# Paths semgrep skips. Run via `just sec-sast` (and the `sast` CI job).
#
# Test code is excluded the way the Go sibling excludes `_test.go`: fixtures
# with hard-coded hosts / credentials / eval-style helpers are noise for SAST.
# This does NOT hide them from secret scanning — gitleaks does not read this
# file and covers the whole tree + history, e2e specs included.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
e2e/playwright-report/
e2e/test-results/
benchmarks/results/
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts
